Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:11.36,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hey, luckiest kid in the \Nworld who got to become my student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:14.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hello, my beloved master!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.49,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I won't hold back on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:17.66,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:19.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:22.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I welcome any difficult training!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you hold back, I'll cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:26.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So, what do we start with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A three-dimensional magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Or an oblique magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:35.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My request is the 50-section \Ncompound spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:12.00,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,INCREDIBLE TRAINING\NAND INCREDIBLE RESULTS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:08.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.45,0:02:10.45,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Man, thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:13.88,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I was looking for someone who can \Nmake clean copies of my memos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:15.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,All of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:17.49,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And there'll be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:20.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Don't you love me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:22.37,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I never have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.37,main,IKO,0,0,0,,So merciless and cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:27.57,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,These here are state secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.57,0:02:30.16,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You stay outside until he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.32,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Please don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.88,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:36.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:44.52,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hey, make me that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:54.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master sure loves this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:55.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:59.24,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Shall I make you some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.24,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.74,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sword training?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:10.37,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.43,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I've only just begun, \Nand I have much to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:17.79,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I want to practice whenever \NI have spare time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:21.62,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Please do not tell Kunon about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:23.51,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:33.85,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.05,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,I must become someone\Nsuitable for Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:55.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A diagram?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:02.68,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:04.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,About halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:05.80,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You're slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:09.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Don't say that with such luminous skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:13.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted from trying \Nto decipher your scrawls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.94,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,My memos, you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.47,0:04:19.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This letter looks just like an \Nearthworm writhing by the wayside
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,because it carelessly came out \Nof the comfort of damp ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:26.48,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Don't you compare my wisdom \Nwith a hopeless situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,May I send you an invoice for my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.52,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:33.00,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,This is significant training, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:37.19,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Information and knowledge are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:43.58,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What you can gain from \Nreading is just information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:48.61,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What you analyze in your head \Nand write with your own hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:50.65,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,your body remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:53.89,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It becomes knowledge that's wildly \Ndifferent from information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:57.31,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And knowledge becomes power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's my master! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:08.87,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,See ya. Make sure to finish \Neverything by next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:09.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:13.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, there was a memo of a diagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:16.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Was it some sort of spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:20.48,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,That one... It'll be quicker to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:22.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Next time, you come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:35.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm happy that I get to see you often,\Nthanks to Master visiting me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.13,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:40.43,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Don't confuse the means with the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.78,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Oh, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:48.67,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Did you grow taller?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:51.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm ten years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:52.95,main,ROYAL SORCERER 1,0,0,0,,A growth spurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:55.18,main,ROYAL SORCERER 1,0,0,0,,Your magical power has \Nbecome a bit stronger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.10,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Wanna do another magic battle with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:00.20,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:03.80,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Kunon promised that he'd do a \Nflying magic experiment with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.93,main,ROYAL SORCERER 2,0,0,0,,No, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:07.54,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You all get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.43,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,He's here to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:12.67,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,You're monopolizing him again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:13.93,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:15.23,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:16.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:24.11,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Is he taking Kunon to that room?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.07,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,You mustn't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:26.57,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,That place is the world of demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.07,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Make that thing, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:38.21,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You know what magic tools are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:41.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. They're tools that work with \Na sorcerer's magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:45.47,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Right. For example, this lamp \Nis a magic tool of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:50.72,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Magical engineers are sorcerers who \Nmake their living by creating magic tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:52.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Magical engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:59.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wow! It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are all of these your scrawls, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.45,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You mean memos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:09.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is a spell I've never tried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:11.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I wanted this grimoire so much
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:16.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,that I tried to rely on Father's \Ncollusion with His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master, I want to live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You don't need to use \Ncollusion or live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.92,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Eventually you can have it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.50,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,This is the magic tool \NI'm developing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.18,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It's what was in the diagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:37.78,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,When it's completed, you can eat \Na piping-hot meal in your own room
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:41.43,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,without going to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:45.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You can bake an apple pie in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:46.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.82,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,My earth magic is good \Nfor modeling shapes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:53.95,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,but the fine details and \Nsoft parts are not so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:59.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Soft parts... Do you think \Nmy water magic can make them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.98,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You pick up quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:06.28,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Eventually, you'll help with my work, \Nwhich will double as experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:08.71,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:10.96,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:12.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hello, Grand Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:15.49,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:21.98,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,As promised, why don't we discuss \Nthe essence of magic over lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.98,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Make that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:35.49,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,My earth magic can take care of \Nreinforcing the outer frame, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:40.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Indeed. And water magic might be better \Nfor the small internal mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:50.77,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,My goodness, Kunon's \Nbed is nice, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:52.52,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Listen, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:56.01,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,If you want to change your teacher, \Ndon't hesitate to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:59.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm being worked to the bone, \Nbut he's a wonderful master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:05.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And water and earth are quite compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:08.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I couldn't have asked anyone better, \Nand I'm grateful to the Grand Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:11.73,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:15.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed because your \Nbeloved student admires you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:19.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's all right. Let us show \Nthem how close we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:21.62,main,ROYAL SORCERERS,0,0,0,,Oh, really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:24.52,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,For my personal safety, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What about Her Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:28.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Since I'm here, I'd love \Nto have some tea with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:32.73,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Mirika is at the entrance ceremony \Nof the senior school for nobles today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.92,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,She was very disappointed \Nshe couldn't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:38.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, her higher education has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.71,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,And what do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:46.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If it's necessary, \NI'll take the graduation exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.73,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I mean the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:50.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The magic school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:55.25,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,It's a school where bright sorcerers from \Nall over the world attend and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:10:00.24,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,All the Royal Sorcerers here \Nare graduates of that school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:03.88,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You have to be twelve or older to enroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:06.75,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You still have time, \Nbut give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:12.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A school where sorcerers from \Nall over the world attend...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:16.01,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,TWO YEARS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:48.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Compound spell, 55 sections!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:10:59.35,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.85,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:09.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.86,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,It's right out of the oven and so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:23.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This magic tool is quite popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:27.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so I'm sure quite a bit of money \Nis going into Master's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Only Master's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:31.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,May I get paid for my work after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:34.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I allowed you to do \Nexperiments money can't buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:38.29,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll support your livelihood,\N Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:42.38,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I know your talent better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:45.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You sound like the lover of \Na struggling stage actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Will you abandon me \Nwhen you're successful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:50.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:52.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm devoted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:54.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Let's get married in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.12,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wow, so monotonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.66,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sounds fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:05.82,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,You've collaborated on seven \Nmagic tools already, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:09.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. And five papers on \Nnew theories on magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We also made a manual \Nfor magic experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:15.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and we're currently working \Non another magic tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:17.50,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I can do the rest by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:18.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:23.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But we're codeveloping the Chest \Nthat Draws in a Bunch of Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.24,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,"Bunch of" sounds unprofessional.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:27.46,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Call it the Insects Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:31.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How are we completing the \NBunch of Insects Box?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:33.60,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I said no "bunch of."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:38.70,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You're turning twelve this\N spring, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Huh? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:44.65,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to get ready \Nto go to the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:46.11,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,The magic school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I don't want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:50.90,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:55.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I don't need to go, because \NI have you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:59.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I want to learn magic by your \Nside and get worked to the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:01.94,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You've finished making the clean copies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:04.09,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,of my memos and blueprints \Nof magic tools, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:07.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're abandoning me because I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:08.60,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'm not playing along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.39,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'm an earth sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:13.99,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I can't teach water magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:16.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Still, I want you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:21.33,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What if there's an extraordinary \Nwater sorcerer at the magic school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:25.15,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,The world is much bigger than Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:28.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,An extraordinary water sorcerer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:33.16,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Right. Three-star, or if you're \Nlucky, maybe even four-star.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:39.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.13,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:47.83,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,And become an amazing sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:51.53,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'll become a fine woman who is \Nworthy of you and wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:55.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:13:58.52,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:03.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will go to the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:03.97,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?! That far?! I change my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Shut up! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:16.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What exactly do I need to do to \Nprepare for the magic school?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Should I take a change of clothes\Nand the pillow I use every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.86,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You have something much more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I do! A gentleman's sense of humor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:31.09,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You could have said my \Nlessons or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:34.35,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:45.45,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Yes. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:48.61,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:55.38,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,How did I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:59.14,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,My biggest ambition, my fervent wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:02.90,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The most important \Npurpose that I live for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:07.02,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's because I've learned to do \Nso many things without seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:11.18,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Somewhere in my heart, I felt \NI could just go on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:16.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm such a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.91,0:15:26.60,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I hate it! I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:29.02,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You played it cool in \Nfront of your boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:31.86,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,so stop crying already, \Nyou pain in the— Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:39.00,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,In the last two years, Kunon has \Nbuilt his track record as a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:42.32,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,If he gains sight through his magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:44.50,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,he'll go down in history as the first person
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.50,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,to have achieved such a feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:53.93,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,If he goes far away,\NI might get left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:15:58.52,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sir Dario.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:15:59.64,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:06.41,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Part of me can't help but wish that \NKunon's eyes will never see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:08.45,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,so that he'll stay by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:11.28,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I am a despicable woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.78,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Yeah, you are—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.18,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:16.28,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,How many times do you have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:21.43,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,You can voluntarily shut up, \Nor I can shut you up. It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:26.65,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Your Highness, there's light \Nand darkness in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:31.80,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,But please don't get swallowed by \Neither and choose the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.64,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sir Dario.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:35.12,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,It will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:39.02,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,What you've been training for the \Nlast two years isn't just your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:39.78,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Aren't you too lenient on your student?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:44.83,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,You're too strict with your student.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:48.31,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,You drive him into the ground \Nand then abandon him in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:51.95,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,The compound spell of 55 sections, the three-dimensional magic circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:55.41,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,the anchored cylindrical magic \Ncircle, imaginary codes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:17:00.13,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,rheologic sand patterns,\Nand magic tools. I taught him all of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:02.08,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Aren't I the best master there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.96,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,If Master Kunon uses those, \Nwill his eyes be complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:07.61,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:12.86,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that you just \Nfed him a bunch of nonsense...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:16.67,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Watch it! Your darkness is showing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:20.77,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Even I've never heard \Nof how to make eyeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:23.73,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,From here on, it's up to Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.35,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I've no doubt he'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:31.49,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,After all, he's my beloved \Nstudent I'm proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:48.58,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,A mirror that reflects everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.45,0:17:57.63,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Master said that the eye of an insect is \Na cluster of over ten thousand mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:03.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But even if they reflect a whole lot, \Nnothing transmits to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-rubu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:16.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This isn't it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:24.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:32.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,None of these is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:40.55,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,What are you doing in \Nthe middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:42.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Come join me in the sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:46.41,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Sure! Did you invite Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:47.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd hate to wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.37,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,It's worse not to wake him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:52.70,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Father absolutely adores \Nthe sauna you create.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:55.19,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Oh, is it sauna time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:58.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Shh, you'll wake Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.07,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,No, it's worse not to wake her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:13.08,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Ah, that hits the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:15.09,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Ale is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:18.07,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,What a good, manly drinker she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:19.85,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,But I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:22.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is the best way to refresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:27.47,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,It must be a real challenge \Nif you're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's the biggest experiment \NI've done so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.03,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Your eyeballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:37.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm nowhere near close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.98,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,If you need a breather \Nagain, let me know anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.47,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Know that I am at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:46.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.00,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Everyone's so good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.41,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I can't want to see their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.37,0:20:20.47,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,What do their faces look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.33,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I want to see what they see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:35.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:41.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-rubu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.41,0:20:44.03,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The core is the water mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:47.70,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I applied a rheologic sand \Npattern on the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:51.65,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,so that the pattern could read the \Nmoving view and send it to my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:00.95,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,There's no complex configuration \Nor relaying mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:05.56,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,All I had to do was to think simple, \Nwithout worrying about numbers and range.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.99,0:21:15.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:19.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So this is the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:23.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.67,0:21:27.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:37.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can see. I can see. I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:42.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I made eyeballs with magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.77,0:21:47.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:51.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: KUNON THE SORCERER CAN SEE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.86,0:23:39.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Kunon \Nthe Sorcerer Can See."
